<title>MOZAMBIQUE: PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 6.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Mozambique - Feb 6.</headline>
<dateline>MAPUTO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Mozambican press on Thursday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>NOTICIAS</p>
<p>- Police from Mozambique, Zambia, Zimbabwe and South Africa seized 214 vehicles in a joint operation in Mozambique against cross-border car theft, a police spokesman said.</p>
<p>- Fourteen people drowned in floods that have swept across central Mozambique in the past week, cutting off roads and leaving about 3,000 families homeless.</p>
